@baseUrl = https://localhost:9443

### Get API health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Get startup readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ready
Accept: application/json

### Get public Entra configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/config
Accept: application/json

### Get signed-in operator session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ORCHESTRATOR_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Get the OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ORCHESTRATOR_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Load the hosted SPA
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/html
